  "label": "Concept of 'Bootleg Copy' as Illegitimate or Low-Quality",
  "description": "The phrase 'bootleg copy' refers to an unauthorized, often low-quality, imitation of a copyrighted or proprietary product. In this context, it is used humorously (and mockingly) to imply that the 'Muslim porn' is a cheap, fake, or inferior version. This requires understanding of copyright law and internet slang to interpret the joke's tone and context.",
